# ===============================
# Unreal Engine (General)
# ===============================

# Build results
Binaries/
Build/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/

# Local config overrides
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs

# Unreal crash reports
*.dmp
*.log

